      "updated": 1790586433178,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "All threads run the exact same instructions, so all 128 do the\ncheck. \nThe 100 with a real element pass; the 28 extras skip the work.\n\nResult: The same programs works for ANY vector length, not just\nmultiples of 32.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "0E6hru4pz1HxNWmTPp5er",
      "originalText": "All threads run the exact same instructions, so all 128 do the check. \nThe 100 with a real element pass; the 28 extras skip the work.\n\nResult: The same programs works for ANY vector length, not just multiples of 32.",
